        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "It would be cool to have some plugins in separate repositories to lazily load some of them.\r\n\r\nFor example, now I'm loading some of the plugins (pairs, cursorword) on the BufReadPost event, but I can't specify another events for other plugins (starter, sessions).",
